		<label>Draw crest outline of Virility</label>
		<description>Draw a crest outline of virility onto the pubic region.</description>
		<descriptionHyperlinks>
			<HediffDef>AppliedCrestOutline_Virility</HediffDef>
		</descriptionHyperlinks>
